&lt;li&gt;Identify new use case opportunities and showcase value to existing customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional engineering and product teams to deliver the most value back to your customers, aligned with the adoption of our platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with system integrators, ISVs and cloud partners to help customers build a world-class data and AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive business and technical consultancy for businesses to scale their data &amp;amp; company strategies effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the value of Databricks&#39; Data Intelligence Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure 100% satisfaction among all customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience driving consumption growth and closing commit deals in a direct sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in relevant software sales roles with a consumption-based sales motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some exposure to the software industry and some basic concepts of selling SAAS, Big Data and Business Value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of the data platform and cloud ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the life cycle of a startup and its decision-making process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience exceeding sales targets/quotas&lt;/li&gt;
